    <string name="welcome_body">• Write with the pen, scroll and zoom with fingers.\n• Everything is saved on the device as you write (“Saved on device”).\n• If zoom gets in the way, lock it with the padlock at the bottom.\n• Hold the pen still at the end of a line to snap it to a shape.\n• Long-press a note and choose “Open side by side” to view two notes.\n• Two-finger tap = undo</string>
